[{"type":"message","user":"U02894EN7A6","text":"\u003c@U02894EN7A6\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1626780870.440900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"d70bb51a-2461-4dcf-844a-3cea86912212","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"vscode/vscodium, Google chrome, vivaldi, skype あたりもか。","ts":"1626772447.440500","edited":{"user":"U013QL1RAPN","ts":"1626772770.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BKfh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6f98035-eca6-4139-8173-f95682357c9d","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"docker のリポジトリも外部ですね…","ts":"1626771368.439800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G/tk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6aa50746-592e-4ce0-88cf-12618fe7a4f5","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"crystal も外部リポジトリだし、それなりに見かける気はする。","ts":"1626770233.439400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Osq"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U023ARW8CGG","text":"\u003c@U023ARW8CGG\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1626751558.437900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"54df3d7a-7ff9-4fda-84d2-8e9001f4c70d","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"\u003chttps://hnakamur.github.io/blog/2020/12/10/alternative-script-for-apt-key-add/#%E4%BB%A3%E6%9B%BF%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AA%E3%83%97%E3%83%88%E3%81%AE%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9|https://hnakamur.github.io/blog/2020/12/10/alternative-script-for-apt-key-add/#%E4%BB%A3%E6%9B%BF%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AA%E3%83%97%E3%83%88%E3%81%AE%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9\u003e","ts":"1626738539.437200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Pg="}]},{"client_msg_id":"5091535f-8568-4282-ad61-8d256a4998ac","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"よほどの事がない限りは外部リポジトリから取り込む事はないと思うんですけどね。ちなみに `adv` も当然ながら非推奨になっています。\n\u003chttps://manpages.debian.org/unstable/apt/apt-key.8.ja.html\u003e","ts":"1626728044.436800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TJhUt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe99a94a-5122-468d-9baa-7948b75af01a","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ここにいる人たち殆どArchばっかりなので他人事なんですが、派生含むDebian系で `apt-key add` が非推奨になってます。かと言って正しいキーの追加方法が分かりにくいと思うのでここに書いておきます。\n・今まで\n`curl -s \u003chttps://dl.k6.io/key.gpg\u003e | sudo apt-key add -`\n・これから\n`curl -fsSL \u003chttps://dl.k6.io/key.gpg\u003e | gpg --dearmor \u0026gt; /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/k6.gpg` (root権限で)\n\n・サンプルに使ったリポジトリ\n\u003chttps://github.com/grafana/k6\u003e","ts":"1626727556.435700","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"grafana/k6","id":1,"title":"grafana/k6","text":"A modern load testing tool, using Go and JavaScript - \u003chttps://k6.io\u003e","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"13036","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Go","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":5,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U9S4G0LJW","U01HXNSLCH5","U0262SQ0LSY","UTMDDL5B9"]},{"name":"hee","count":4,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U022PETR31A","UQX22KG9F","U01HXNSLCH5"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rr66"}]}]
